1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,593
Four curves that look nothing alike, from one construction.

2
00:00:03,593 --> 00:00:09,752
They are the paths of planets and comets, the shape of a satellite dish and a cooling tower.

3
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:14,687
And, as you will see, they all obey one single rule.

